### Test API Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Create New Employee
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Sarah",
  "last_name": "Johnson",
  "email": "sarah.johnson@example.com",
  "phone": "+1987654321",
  "department": "Marketing",
  "position": "Marketing Manager",
  "salary": 85000.00,
  "hire_date": "2024-01-20",
  "address": "456 Park Avenue, New York, NY 10002",
  "is_active": true
}

### Create Another Employee
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Mike",
  "last_name": "Wilson",
  "email": "mike.wilson@example.com",
  "phone": "+1555123456",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "position": "DevOps Engineer",
  "salary": 92000.00,
  "hire_date": "2024-01-10",
  "address": "789 Tech Park, San Francisco, CA 94105",
  "is_active": true
}

### Create Employee with Minimal Fields (required only)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Emma",
  "last_name": "Brown",
  "email": "emma.brown@example.com",
  "department": "Sales",
  "position": "Sales Representative",
  "salary": 65000.00,
  "hire_date": "2024-01-25"
}

### Try to Create Duplicate Employee (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Duplicate",
  "last_name": "User",
  "email": "sarah.johnson@example.com",
  "department": "IT",
  "position": "Developer",
  "salary": 70000.00,
  "hire_date": "2024-01-30"
}